# sqlx checksums each migration byte for byte and refuses to start if one
# changes after it has been applied. Line-ending translation counts as a
# change: core.autocrlf rewrote a migration on checkout once and the service
# crash-looped on VersionMismatch until it was put back.
#
# `-text` freezes these files exactly as committed, in whichever ending each
# was applied with, so a checkout can never rewrite them again.
migrations/*.sql -text
